  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Support to MFAEI Moldova - MFAEI Negotiations EU Moldova AA Phase 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Institutionellt st&#xf6;d till MFAEI Moldavien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att st&#xe4;rka den institutionella kapaciteten p&#xe5;   det Moldaviska utrikesministeriet som ocks&#xe5; ansvarar f&#xf6;r              europaintegration. En ny komponent syftar specifik till att st&#xe4;rka    det team som ska f&#xf6;rhandla fram ett nytt avtal mellan EU och          Moldavien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Te project specific objective is strengthening the institutional      capacity of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and European Integration  so that it can exercise its functions in a more efficient manner and  is able to develop, implement and monitor long-term policies. MFAEI   phase 2 Dec No 2009-005236 focusses on (1) CPAR implementation and    (2)support to negotiation of new Aassociation Agreement with EU.</narrative>
  </description>
